# EPA CDR (TSCA Chemical Data Reporting) markdown/CSV conversions — 270 MB of
# bulk industrial-chemical data; wrong granularity for the pesticide product
# catalog. Keep local, do not commit. The RUP report under
# research/regulatory/markdown_conversions/ is 1 MB and stays tracked.
research/regulatory/cdr_markdown_conversions/

